{"number":107,"name":"سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ","englishName":"Al-Maa'un","englishNameTranslation":"Almsgiving","numberOfAyahs":7,"items":[{"id":"q:107:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","en":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?","bn":"আপনি কি দেখেছেন তাকে, যে বিচারদিবসকে মিথ্যা বলে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/1"},{"id":"q:107:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","en":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan","bn":"সে সেই ব্যক্তি, যে এতীমকে গলা ধাক্কা দেয়","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/2"},{"id":"q:107:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","en":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor.","bn":"এবং মিসকীনকে অন্ন দিতে উৎসাহিত করে না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/3"},{"id":"q:107:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَوَيْلٌۭ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","en":"So woe to those who pray","bn":"অতএব দুর্ভোগ সেসব নামাযীর,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/4"},{"id":"q:107:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","en":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer -","bn":"যারা তাদের নামায সম্বন্ধে বে-খবর;","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/5"},{"id":"q:107:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","en":"Those who make show [of their deeds]","bn":"যারা তা লোক-দেখানোর জন্য করে","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/6"},{"id":"q:107:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":107,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-Maa'un","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ","en":"And withhold [simple] assistance.","bn":"এবং নিত্য ব্যবহার্য্য বস্তু অন্যকে দেয় না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/107/7"}]}